---
alwaysApply: true
---

This project uses the AIDD framework. Skills are in `ai/skills/`. The vision document is `vision.md`. Read vision.md before any task.

Available AIDD workflows — load the corresponding SKILL.md to execute the workflow:
- Bug fixing: `ai/skills/aidd-fix/SKILL.md`
- Feature discovery: `ai/skills/aidd-please/SKILL.md` with /discover
- Task epic creation: `ai/skills/aidd-please/SKILL.md` with /task
- Implementation with TDD: `ai/skills/aidd-please/SKILL.md` with /execute
- Code review: `ai/skills/review/SKILL.md`
- PR management: `ai/skills/aidd-pr/SKILL.md`
- Structured reasoning: `ai/skills/aidd-rtc/SKILL.md`
- Hotspot analysis: `npx aidd churn --days 90 --top 20`
